G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B5.000 C0.000
M0 (Check B plus 5. Confirm positive direction and compare against the square)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B-5.000 C0.000
M0 (Check B minus 5. Confirm symmetry around zero)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B15.000 C0.000
M0 (Check B plus 15. Confirm the encoder follows the expected direction)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B-15.000 C0.000
M0 (Check B minus 15. Confirm the return path is repeatable)
G1 X1500.000 Y850.000 Z-600.000 B0.000 C0.000
